2. MANDATORY MANDATE FOR PEACEFUL AND CIVILIAN USE (JHL-SAFE CLAUSE)
As an unalterable condition of this license grant, any implementation, replication, manufacturing, scale-up, or commercialization of the 360-qubit Lotus Core-V3 Ultra architecture or its derived multi-die assets is strictly bound to peaceful, civilian, ecological, and medical research infrastructure deployment. 

Any defense-sector integration, military weaponization, or deployment within defense systems is explicitly prohibited under this mandate. Furthermore, this architecture completely rejects any calculative alignment, simulation, or optimization relating to nuclear weapons, enriched fissile tracking, or weapons of mass destruction in compliance with non-proliferation standards.

3. DISCLAIMER OF LIABILITY & MEDICAL USE
This framework represents absolute theoretical in-silico hardware and simulation modeling. The computational results are for academic and engineering review only. They do not constitute, replace, or imply clinical diagnosis, medical advice, or specific pharmaceutical treatment protocols for human subjects. Any physiological or physical deployment remains subject to independent chemical verification and standard national regulatory accreditation. AI-generated architectural components require standard professional metallurgical, cryptographic, and lithographic review prior to fabrication.
